_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='industrial-fairway-supply' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Industrial Food Ingredients Co. (IFI) was founded in 1989 as a family-owned business in Hunt Valley, Maryland. The company operates from a post office box in nearby Westminster and serves the Mid-Atlantic region, including Delaware, Maryland, New Jersey, New York, Pennsylvania, Virginia, Washington, D.C., and West Virginia.

IFI functions as an ingredient supplier, providing a broad portfolio of food ingredients to manufacturers and product developers. Its offerings encompass nuts, fruits, vegetables, chocolate coatings, fillings, coatings and grinds, and other specialty items. The company manages the procurement process from start to finish, handling contract administration, market-price monitoring, crop updates, and document fulfillment, while also supplying product samples for new-product development.

The supplier’s customer base spans confectionery, ice cream, natural-products, and broader food-manufacturing sectors. Membership in the American Association of Candy Technologists, the North East Ice Cream Association, the Pennsylvania Manufacturing Confectioners Association, the Natural Products Food Expo, and the Institute of Food Technologists reflects a focus on candy, frozen desserts, clean-label foods, and technical food applications. Research Chefs Association membership also points to culinary and food-service clients.

IFI’s stated differentiator is a service-first philosophy summed up by the motto that communication is the key ingredient to success. The company promises end-to-end order service, prompt call returns, regular contract updates, competitive pricing intelligence, new-ingredient alerts, money-saving proposals, and dedicated document fulfillment.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Ingredient sourcing and supply", "Contract management", "Market price monitoring", "Product knowledge and new ingredient information", "Cost-saving proposals", "Crop updates", "Product sample provision", "Document fulfillment"], "industries": ["Confectionery", "Ice cream", "Natural products", "Food technology"], "materials": ["Nuts", "Fruits", "Vegetables", "Chocolate coatings", "Fillings", "Grinds", "Specialty food ingredients"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["End-to-end order service from placement to delivery", "Contract management with regular updates", "Real-time market price monitoring and competitive pricing", "Product sampling for new product development", "Crop updates and cost-saving proposals"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1989 -> db, page /", "Family-owned and operated -> description, page /", "Headquartered in Hunt Valley, MD -> db, page /", "Ingredient supplier providing sales of all types of ingredients -> description, page /", "Services: order management, contract management, market monitoring, product knowledge, cost-saving proposals, crop updates, product sampling, document fulfillment -> page /", "Associations: American Association of Candy Technologists, F.I.N.D. Group, Institute of Food Technologists, Natural Products Food Expo, North East Ice Cream Association, Pennsylvania Manufacturing Confectioners Association, Research Chefs Association -> page /", "Key personnel: Scott Hetherington (President), Sharon Black (VP Sales), Penny Kirdy (Office Manager), Theresa Mauldin (Customer Service Representative