UPDATE companies SET description='Industrial Packaging Corporation began in 1988 in Tomahawk, Wisconsin, and today operates from its headquarters in Wilton, Iowa, with additional production facilities in Arcadia, Wisconsin, and Fort Payne, Alabama. The company has remained a U.S.-based manufacturer since its inception.

The company produces a range of recyclable packaging solutions, including corrugated angle pads with non-scuff coatings, honeycomb pads and structural honeycomb components, shaft packs, and wine bottle packaging. Its honeycomb products serve as internal supports for metal bathroom partitions and as blocking and bracing risers for transit protection. All products are made from paper sourced from mills that use recycled fibers, with more than half of the purchased paper containing 100 percent recycled content.

The company also offers a Vision Design service to tailor packaging to specific product specifications.

The business emphasizes its domestic manufacturing heritage and sustainability profile, noting that every product it manufactures is recyclable and that its paper supply chain prioritizes recycled content. This focus on recycled materials and U.S. production has been a consistent theme since the company''s founding.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Corrugated angle pad manufacturing", "Non-scuff coating application", "Honeycomb pad and packaging manufacturing", "Structural honeycomb fabrication", "Shaft pack manufacturing", "Wine bottle packaging", "Custom packaging design (Vision Design)", "Blocking and bracing solutions"], "industries": ["Wine and beverage", "Construction and building materials", "Industrial shipping and logistics", "General manufacturing and packaging"], "materials": ["Paper", "Recycled paper fibers", "100% recycled content paper", "Corrugated fiberboard", "Honeycomb paperboard"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["All packaging manufactured is recyclable", "Over 50% of paper purchased is 100% recycled content", "Made in the USA since 1988", "Custom packaging design through Vision Design service", "Honeycomb structural components for blocking and bracing"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1988 in Tomahawk, Wisconsin -> page ''/''", "Headquarters in Wilton, IA -> db and page ''/''", "Locations in Tomahawk, WI; Arcadia, WI; Fort Payne, AL -> page ''/''", "Products: corrugated angle pads, honeycomb pads, shaft pack, wine bottle pack -> page ''/''", "Recyclable packaging, recycled content paper -> page ''/''", "Made in USA since 1988 -> page ''/''", "Structural honeycomb for bathroom partitions -> page ''/''", "Honeycomb pads for blocking and bracing -> page ''/''", "Vision Design service -> page ''/''", "Sales managers listed -> page ''/''"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "All IPC products have been made in the USA since the company began in