UPDATE companies SET description='Innovative Sensor Technology USA Division operates from Las Vegas, Nevada, established in 2001 as the American sales and support office of Innovative Sensor Technology IST AG, a Swiss sensor manufacturer founded in 1991 in Ebnat‑Kappel. IST AG became part of the Endress+Hauser Group, a global leader in process measurement instrumentation headquartered in Reinach, Switzerland.

The company develops and manufactures temperature sensors, thermal mass flow sensors, humidity sensors, conductivity sensors, biosensors, micro heaters, and infrared emitters. It offers custom sensor adaptations, joint technology development, and consulting from its state‑of‑the‑art facilities in Switzerland and a production site in Rožnov, Czech Republic. The U.S. division maintains on‑site stock for supply‑chain programs and supports flexible order quantities with short development and production cycles.

Sensors serve medical technology, process control, automation, electric vehicles, aerospace, test and measurement, biotechnology, food and beverage, and emission monitoring. The portfolio includes ESCC‑qualified thin‑film platinum temperature sensors for space applications and nucleic‑acid extraction platforms for life‑science customers.

IST emphasizes accuracy and consistency across measurement conditions, backed by ISO 9001:2015 and ISO 14001:2015 certification. Its differentiators include the only Hi‑Rel ESCC‑certified thin‑film platinum sensors, end‑to‑end development from concept to after‑sales support, and a commitment to producing varying volumes quickly.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','ISO 14001:2015','ESCC qualification']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Development and manufacturing of temperature sensors", "Development and manufacturing of thermal mass flow sensors", "Development and manufacturing of humidity sensors", "Development and manufacturing of conductivity sensors", "Development and manufacturing of biosensors", "Development and manufacturing of micro heaters", "Development and manufacturing of infrared emitters", "Sensor adaptations and customizations", "Joint development of new sensor technologies", "Sensor technology development and consulting", "Component overmolding in electronics", "Quality assurance (ISO 9001:2015, ISO 14001:2015)", "Full production process: conception, material selection, sampling, serial production, quality control, after\u2011sales consulting", "Flexible quantities and fast production", "Supply chain programs and on\u2011site stock (USA Division)", "Technical consulting and support", "Nucleic acid extraction technologies (spin filter, magnetic beads, polymer mediated enrichment)", "Force, pressure, strain and displacement sensor development (iST Senstech)", "Thermal infrared emitters for gas analysis and spectroscopy (Infrasolid)"], "industries": ["Medical technology (med\u2011tech)", "Process control", "Automation", "Electric vehicles (EVs)", "Aerospace", "Test and measurement", "Biotechnology", "Food and beverage", "Emission monitoring", "Oil and gas (moisture in oil monitoring)", "Life sciences (nucleic acid extraction)", "Space (Hi\u2011Rel applications)", "High reliability (Hi\u2011Rel) applications", "Conductivity measurement across in