UPDATE companies SET description='InterConnect Electronics is a woman-owned small business based in Elkridge, Maryland, within the Baltimore-Washington Industrial Corridor. The company was incorporated in 1990 and has operated for over 35 years as a contract manufacturer specializing in custom cable and harness assemblies.

The firm produces custom cable and harness assemblies as well as electro-mechanical box builds, offering engineering support and design partnership from early concept through production. Its technicians follow WHMA-IPC soldering and assembly standards, with multiple IPC-certified specialists and an IPC trainer on staff. Strategic procurement practices and a 35-year vendor network enable sourcing of obsolete components.

InterConnect serves medical robotics equipment manufacturers, the car wash and car care industry across the U.S. and Europe, major U.S. defense contractors, OEMs, global manufacturing companies, and essential industries.

