UPDATE companies SET description='Interstate Wire Co Inc has operated from Rockwall, Texas since its founding in 1977. The company began as a distributor of electronic and electrical wire, cable, and wire management products, building a catalog sourced from major manufacturers such as Belden, General Cable, Harbour Industries, and Thomas & Betts.

Today the firm stocks a broad line that includes hook-up wire, multi-conductor cable, coaxial cables, portable cordage, flat cable, molded cable assemblies, and related wire management products. Beyond distribution, it runs full-service wire preparation operations—respooling, shrink-wrapping, twisting, and striping—as well as pre-production services such as light assembly and custom kitting to streamline customer workflows.

The customer base spans automotive and transportation OEMs, power distribution sub-assemblers, building systems contractors, medical device makers, military and aerospace programs, marine builders, and mining and construction firms. In each sector the company supplies product that meets relevant ratings and traceability requirements.

Interstate Wire emphasizes a quality system certified to ISO 9001:2015, with internal audits twice yearly and external audits annually. It also maintains REACH, RoHS, and conflict-minerals compliance declarations. The company positions itself as a partner that simplifies production through quick-turn fulfillment and value-added preparation rather than simply moving boxes.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','REACH compliance','RoHS compliance','Conflict Minerals compliance (CFSI/CMRT)']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Wire preparation services", "Respooling", "Shrink-wrapping", "Twisting", "Striping", "Light assembly", "Custom kitting", "Distribution of electronic wire and cable", "Value-added services"], "industries": ["Automotive", "Power Distribution", "Building Systems", "Medical", "Military & Aerospace", "Marine", "Mining & Construction"], "materials": ["Hook-Up Wire", "Multi-Conductor Cable", "Coaxial Cables", "Portable Cordage", "Flat Cable", "Molded Cable Assemblies", "Wire Management products"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Quick-turn order fulfillment", "Full-service wire preparation (respooling, shrink-wrapping, twisting, striping)", "Pre-production prep including light assembly and custom kitting", "ISO 9001:2015 quality system with continuous improvement", "Compliance declarations for REACH, RoHS, and conflict minerals"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1977 -> db", "Headquarters Rockwall, Texas -> db", "ISO 9001:2015 certification -> /about-us", "REACH, RoHS, Conflict Minerals compliance -> /about-us", "Core product lines (hook-up wire, multi-conductor, coaxial, portable cordage, flat cable, molded assemblies, wire management) -> /about-us", "Value-add services: respooling, shrink-wrapping, twisting, striping, light assembly, custom kitting -> /", "Industries served: Automotive, Power Distribution, Building Systems, Medical, Military & Aerospace, Marine, Mining & Construction -> /", "Manufacturers carr