UPDATE companies SET description='Iron It Out operates from Springfield, Vermont, where Dante Garganese III has spent over a quarter of a century handcrafting custom architectural metalwork.

The workshop builds custom fireplace doors (glass and screen styles), barn-door screens, standard and custom fireplace screens, iron and cable railings, balusters, range hoods, ADA-compliant handrail systems, spiral staircases, ship ladders, and lawn-and-garden pieces. Each screen and door is custom-fitted to the hearth and backed by a one-year warranty; items are fabricated in Vermont and shipped directly to the customer.

Customers range from homeowners and interior designers to contractors in Vermont and New Hampshire, as well as commercial and institutional clients. Testimonials cite projects for private residences, a church entrance arbor (Saint Paul''s), and builders experienced with banks and schools, indicating both residential and light-commercial work.

The company emphasizes meticulous handcrafting, heirloom-quality construction, and fluency in multiple materials and finishes. Its stated aim is to translate a client''s vision into a finished piece that adds dignity and elegance to interior or exterior settings, whether the starting point is a homeowner''s sketch, a designer''s drawing, or a historic reference such as a Montepulciano handrail.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom wrought iron fabrication", "Fireplace door manufacturing (glass and screen)", "Fireplace screen manufacturing (standard, barn door style)", "Iron railing fabrication", "Cable railing systems", "Baluster production", "Range hood fabrication", "ADA compliant handrail systems", "Spiral staircase construction", "Ship ladder construction", "Custom architectural metalwork", "Lawn and garden ironwork"], "industries": ["Residential construction", "Commercial construction", "Architectural metalwork", "Home renovation", "Interior design"], "materials": ["Wrought iron", "Various metals and finishes"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Custom-fitted fireplace screens and doors with one-year warranty", "Nationwide shipping from Vermont workshop", "ADA-compliant handrail systems", "Custom spiral staircases and ship ladders"], "facts_used": ["Location: Springfield, Vermont -> db (hq_city, hq_state_label)", "Founder: Dante Garganese III -> page ''/''", "Family-owned (Dante and Son) -> page ''/''", "Over 25 years experience -> page ''/''", "Products: fireplace doors, screens, railings, balusters, range hoods, ADA handrails, spiral staircases, ship ladders, lawn & garden -> page ''/''", "Custom-fitted, one-year warranty, ships nationwide -> page ''/''", "Residential and commercial clients, contractors in VT/NH, church and institutional projects -> page ''/''", "Handcrafted, heirloom-quality, multiple materials/finishes -> page ''/''"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "For over a quarter of a century, Dante Garganese III has meticulously handcrafted custom architectural metalwork and fireplace doors and screens for discerning connoisseurs throughout New England and North America.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='iron-it-out' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='IronStrong Metal Fabrication Inc. (ISMF) operates from a leased facility at 230 North 4th Street in Columbia, Pennsylvania, within Lancaster County. The company is organized as a limited liability company with managing members, though a founding year and individual founders are not disclosed in public materials. It was established to serve as a single-source metal fabrication partner for customers in the region and beyond.

The shop delivers prototype through full production runs across welding, fabrication, CNC machining, laser cutting, powder coating, and forming. Welding capabilities cover MIG and TIG processes on aluminum, stainless steel, and carbon steel. A high-precision vertical machining center with a fourth axis and CNC lathes handle milled and turned components. A Mitsubishi laser cuts mild steel, stainless, aluminum, galvanized, copper, brass, and titanium up to one inch thick depending on material. A Mitsubishi Diamond press brake provides high-speed, precise bending of sheet metal and plate. Powder coating rounds out the in-house finish options.

While the company serves general manufacturing, its stated market focus targets the entertainment and utility sectors. Early projects include fabricating wire pullers for the utility industry under a patent leased from a managing member, and welding barricades for entertainment applications. The firm also engages subcontractors on an as-needed basis to supplement capacity.

ISMF positions itself as a one-stop shop that actualizes custom work exactly to customer designs, emphasizing high-quality workmanship across all processes. The managing members aim to grow the operation substantially while representing Lancaster County on a national stage.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["MIG welding", "TIG welding", "CNC milling (4th axis)", "CNC turning", "Laser cutting", "Powder coating", "Press brake forming", "Fabrication (laser cutting, welding, machining, forming)", "Prototyping", "Production runs"], "industries": ["Entertainment industry", "Utility industry", "General manufacturing"], "materials": ["Aluminum", "Stainless steel", "Carbon steel", "Galvanized steel", "Copper", "Brass", "Titanium"], "equipment": ["Mitsubishi laser", "Mitsubishi Diamond press brake", "High precision/heavy duty vertical machining center with 4th axis", "CNC lathes"], "volume": "Prototype through production runs", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["One-stop shop covering prototype through production in welding, machining, laser cutting, powder coating, and forming", "Mitsubishi laser cutting up to 1\" thick in steel, stainless, aluminum, and other metals", "Mitsubishi Diamond press brake for high-speed, precise sheet metal and plate forming", "Vertical machining center with 4th axis and CNC lathes for milled and turned parts", "MIG and TIG welding of aluminum, stainless steel, and carbon steel"], "facts_used": ["Location: Columbia, PA (230 N. 4th St) -> /about-us", "LLC with managing members -> /about-us", "Services: welding, fabrication, CNC machining, laser cutting, powder coating, forming -> /", "MIG/TIG welding on aluminum, stainless, steel -> /", "Vertical machining center with 4th axis, CNC lathes -> /", "Mitsubishi laser cutting capacities per material/thickness -> /", "Mitsubishi Diamond press brake for forming -> /", "Prototype through production -> /", "Focus on entertainment and utility industries -> /about-us"