UPDATE companies SET description='Ironwood Manufacturing Inc. The company describes its heritage as "Montana built" and emphasizes an honest handshake and fair dealing as foundations of its operation.

The firm produces a range of ready-to-assemble and custom furniture for educational and institutional settings. Its eight product lines include the Glacier series for library circulation desks and shelving, Denali mobile cabinets for classrooms and maker spaces, Arches tables with configurable frames and tops, Teton music storage for instruments and uniforms, plus the General Line, Sequoia administration desks, Grand Canyon computer workstations, and Yosemite heavy-duty furniture for industrial arts. Since 2003 the company has expanded its ready-to-assemble offerings alongside its custom-project roots.

The furniture also serves music programs, computer labs, and administrative offices, with products designed for high-use environments such as classrooms, shared workspaces, and performance areas.

Ironwood cites its combination of long‑term craftsmanship, practical design, and product lines tailored to real school use as its differentiator. The company highlights its custom-project origins, school‑and‑library focus, ready‑to‑assemble line, and TIPS contract availability as reasons customers have relied on it for over 40 years.', certifications=ARRAY['TIPS Contract 230301 — Furniture, Furnishings, and Services','EDGAR Compliance']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Furniture manufacturing", "Ready-to-assemble (RTA) furniture production", "Custom furniture design and fabrication", "Library furniture systems (circulation desks, shelving, carrels)", "Mobile storage cabinets", "Table manufacturing (configurable frames and tops)", "Music instrument and uniform storage", "Administration and office furniture", "Computer workstation fabrication", "Heavy-duty industrial arts furniture"], "industries": ["K-12 education", "Public libraries", "Government/public agencies", "Music education", "Computer labs", "Industrial arts education", "Office furniture"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Custom furniture project roots with a school and library focus", "Ready-to-assemble (RTA) product lines introduced in 2003", "Awarded TIPS vendor (Contract 230301) for cooperative purchasing", "Built to last, designed for daily institutional use"], "facts_used": ["Location: Missoula, Montana -> /", "Family-owned since the 1980s -> /", "Eight product lines (Glacier, Denali, Arches, Teton, General, Sequoia, Grand Canyon, Yosemite) -> /", "Ready-to-assemble expansion in 2003 -> /", "TIPS Contract 230301 for Furniture, Furnishings, and Services -> /", "EDGAR Compliance -> /", "Serves schools, libraries, offices, music programs, computer labs, industrial arts -> /", "Company closing after 40+ years, no longer accepting new orders -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Ironwood Manufacturing has been building solid, sensible furniture in the Rocky Mountain West since the ''80s.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='ironwood-manufacturing-inc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='It''s Electric Hawaii is a locally owned and operated electrical service company based in Honolulu, Hawaii. The business was founded with a mission to deliver high-quality electrical services that clients can rely on, though a specific founding year is not publicly stated. The company is comprised of certified electricians and operates as a fully licensed and insured entity in the state of Hawaii.

The company provides a comprehensive range of electrical services for residential, commercial, and industrial customers. Its offerings include electrical upgrades and improvements, safety and security system installations, 24/7 emergency repair services, and energy-efficient solutions such as LED lighting installations and energy audits. The team handles projects from simple repairs to complex installations, using top-grade materials and adhering to industry standards. No facility size, headcount, or annual volume figures are disclosed.

It''s Electric Hawaii serves homeowners, businesses, and industrial facilities across Honolulu and Kapolei. Customer reviews highlight work on residential kitchen remodels, restaurant electrical systems, and solar battery installations. The company also works with construction industry professionals and property managers seeking reliable electrical contractors.

The company emphasizes several differentiators: it holds all required Hawaii licenses and insurance, employs experienced electricians who receive ongoing training, offers transparent pricing with detailed upfront estimates, and maintains a safety-first approach on every job. A 24/7 emergency response capability and a customer-centric service model are also cited as core strengths.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Residential electrical services", "Commercial electrical services", "Industrial electrical services", "Emergency electrical repair", "Electrical upgrades and improvements", "Safety and security system installation", "Energy-efficient solutions", "LED lighting installation", "Energy audits"], "industries": ["Residential", "Commercial", "Industrial", "Energy efficiency", "Construction", "Hospitality"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Licensed and insured in Hawaii", "24/7 emergency electrical service", "Transparent pricing with no hidden fees", "Experienced electricians with ongoing training", "Safety-first protocols on every job"], "facts_used": ["Locally owned and operated in Honolulu, Hawaii -> db", "Licensed and insured electrical services for residential and commercial properties -> /", "Journey began with a mission to deliver high-quality electrical services -> /about-us", "Services: residential, commercial, industrial, emergency, upgrades, safety, energy-efficient solutions, LED lighting, energy audits -> /, /about-us", "Serves Honolulu and Kapolei; customers include homeowners, restaurants, construction professionals -> /", "Differentiators: licensed/insured, experienced electricians, prompt/reliable, transparent pricing, safety-first, 24/7 emergency -> /, /about-us"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "We are a fully licensed and insured company comprised of certified electricians.", "founded_year": "", "