UPDATE companies SET description='JFD-PK Medical LLC is based in Center Valley, Pennsylvania. The company was founded by Dr. Jameel Durrani, a board-certified pulmonologist and critical care physician with more than 20 years of clinical experience. Dr. Durrani established the company to pursue innovations in bedside critical care medicine, driven by a passion for improving the quality of care for critically ill patients.

