UPDATE companies SET description='KW Solar Solutions, Inc. was founded in 2004 as a family-owned business in Elkton, Maryland. Dale Wolf, the company’s president and CEO, is an original founder and owner-operator who holds NABCEP certification as both a solar installer and electrician. The firm began with a focus on bringing photovoltaic energy systems to residential customers in the Mid-Atlantic region.

The company designs, installs, and maintains solar photovoltaic systems for residential, commercial, and agricultural clients across Maryland, Delaware, and southern Chester County, Pennsylvania. Its in-house team of master electricians handles every step — custom system design, permitting, utility interconnection agreements, grant applications, and physical installation — without subcontracting.

Customers range from homeowners and small businesses to farms, non-profits, and educational institutions. KW Solar Solutions has completed projects in Cecil and Harford counties in Maryland, New Castle and Kent counties in Delaware, and towns such as Oxford, Avondale, and Kennett Square in Pennsylvania. The company also assists clients with obtaining Renewable Energy Generator certification and selling Solar Renewable Energy Credits (SRECs) through SREC Delaware and SREC Trade.

